{"symbol":"FABCLEAN","yahoo":"FABCLEAN.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Fabtech Cleanrooms Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","website":"https://www.fabtechcleanroom.com","about":"Fabtech Cleanrooms Limited engages in the manufacture of pre-engineered and pre-fabricated modular panels and doors for building cleanrooms in India and internationally. The company offers turnkey solutions for heating, ventilation, and air conditioning; turnkey cleanroom solutions, including design and engineering, manufacturing, installation, validation, and testing; and epoxy floorings. It serves pharma and biopharma, semiconductor, solar power, food, electronics, aerospace, and data center sectors. The company was formerly known as Fabtech Technologies Cleanrooms Limited and changed its name to Fabtech Cleanrooms Limited in May 2026. Fabtech Cleanrooms Limited was incorporated in 2015 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:43:31+00:00","quote":{"price":494.0,"prevClose":504.6,"marketCap":608.58,"high52":575.0,"low52":203.25,"pe":38.47,"bookValue":84.14,"dividendRate":4.0,"roe":16.96,"shares":1.2319,"insiders":72.07,"institutions":5.09},"prices":{"dates":["2025-01-10","2025-01-13","2025-01-14","2025-01-15","2025-01-16","2025-01-17","2025-01-20","2025-01-21","2025-01-22","2025-01-23","2025-01-24","2025-01-27","2025-01-28","2025-01-29","2025-01-30","2025-01-31","2025-02-03","2025-02-04","2025-02-05","2025-02-06","2025-02-07","2025-02-10","2025-02-11","2025-02-12","2025-02-13","2025-02-14","2025-02-17","2025-02-18","2025-02-19","2025-02-20","2025-02-21","2025-02-24","2025-02-25","2025-02-27","2025-02-28","2025-03-03","2025-03-04","2025-03-05","2025-03-06","2025-03-07","2025-03-10","2025-03-11","2025-03-12","2025-03-13","2025-03-17","2025-03-18","2025-03-19","2025-03-20","2025-03-21","2025-03-24","2025-03-25","2025-03-26","2025-03-27","2025-03-28","2025-04-01","2025-04-02","2025-04-03","2025-04-04","2025-04-07","